    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d239-a9-a2">

                <pb facs="0350" n="244" xml:id="pg244"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure B.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Claim of Patrick Shields for $5,000</hi>.</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Valparaiso</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1891-11-20"><hi rendition="#italic">November 20,
                        1891</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Republic of Chile to Patrick Shields, Dr.</p>
                <p>To injuries received at the hands of the police of Valparaiso from the 24th day
                    of October, A. D. 1891, to the 2d day of November, A. D. 1891, inclusive, five
                    thousand dollars United States currency ($5,000).</p>
                <postscript>
                    <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><hi rendition="#small-caps">Consulate
                                of the United States</hi>,<lb/><placeName><hi rendition="#italic"
                                    >Valparaiso</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                                when="1891-11-20"><hi rendition="#italic">November 20,
                                1891</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                    <p>I certify that the foregoing account of Patrick Shields, of the steamship <hi
                            rendition="#italic">Keweenaw</hi>, was presented to me by the said
                        Shields with the request that I forward it to the American minister at
                        Santiago to be by him presented to the proper department for payment.</p>
                    <closer>[<hi rendition="#small-caps">seal</hi>.] <signed><hi
                                rendition="#small-caps">Wm. B. McCreery</hi>,<lb/><hi
                                rendition="#italic">United States Consul</hi>.</signed></closer>
                </postscript>
            </div>
        </body>
